"text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10101858403890501/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-370","post_id":"370","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10101856181379431&set=a.612287952871.2204760.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-01-14","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/370/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-369","post_id":"369","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10101854154915481","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-01-13","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/369/","text":"We're launching Amber Alerts to use the power of our community to help find missing children.\n\nOver the past few years, we've seen people using Facebook on their own to help find kids who have been...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10101854154915481","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-368","post_id":"368","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10101851078206231","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-01-11","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/368/","text":"You can't kill an idea.\n\nIt's inspiring to see the videos of more than two million people of all religions, ages, ethnicities and backgrounds come together to march in unity.\n\nAs long as we are...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_